un and everything that orbits it, including eight planets, dwarf planets, moons, asteroids, and comets. The inner planets (Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars) are rocky, while the outer planets (Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune) are gas or ice giants.',\n112\t      tags: JSON.stringify(['science', 'astronomy', 'space']),\n113\t    },\n114\t    {\n115\t      title: 'Learning Guitar for Beginners',\n116\t      body: 'Starting guitar requires patience and practice. Begin with basic open chords like G, C, D, E minor, and A minor. Practice transitioning between chords smoothly. Learn simple strumming patterns and work on finger strength. Playing just 15 minutes daily will show remarkable progress within weeks.',\n117\t      tags: JSON.stringify(['music', 'guitar', 'learning']),\n118\t    },\n119\t    {\n120\t      title: 'History of Jazz Music',\n121\t      body: 'Jazz originated in the African-American communities of New Orleans in the late 19th and early 20th centuries. It blends elements of blues, ragtime, and European harmony. Key figures include Louis Armstrong, Duke Ellington, Charlie Parker, and Miles Davis. Jazz has evolved through many styles including swing, bebop, and fusion.',\n122\t      tags: JSON.stringify(['music', 'history', 'jazz']),\n123\t    },\n124\t    {\n125\t      title: 'React Hooks Deep Dive',\n126\t      body: 'React Hooks allow you to use state and other React features without writing class components. useState manages local state, useEffect handles side effects, useContext accesses context, and useMemo optimizes performance. Custom hooks let you extract reusable stateful logic.',\n127\t      tags: JSON.stringify(['programming', 'react', 'javascript']),\n128\t    },\n129\t    {\n130\t      title: 'Docker Container Essentials',\n131\t      body: 'Docker containers package applications with their dependencies into standardized units for development, shipment, and deployment. Containers are lightweight, portable, and consistent across environments. Key 