ing, bebop, and fusion.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['music', 'history', 'jazz']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'React Hooks Deep Dive',\n      body: 'React Hooks allow you to use state and other React features without writing class components. useState manages local state, useEffect handles side effects, useContext accesses context, and useMemo optimizes performance. Custom hooks let you extract reusable stateful logic.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['programming', 'react', 'javascript']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Docker Container Essentials',\n      body: 'Docker containers package applications with their dependencies into standardized units for development, shipment, and deployment. Containers are lightweight, portable, and consistent across environments. Key concepts include images, containers, volumes, networks, and docker-compose for multi-container applications.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['programming', 'devops', 'docker']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Mediterranean Diet Benefits',\n      body: 'The Mediterranean diet emphasizes fruits, vegetables, whole grains, legumes, nuts, and olive oil. It includes moderate amounts of fish, poultry, and dairy, with limited red meat. Studies show it reduces risk of heart disease, stroke, type 2 diabetes, and cognitive decline.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['health', 'nutrition', 'diet']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Yoga for Stress Relief',\n      body: 'Yoga combines physical postures, breathing exercises, and meditation to promote relaxation and reduce stress. Regular practice improves flexibility, strength, and mental clarity. Beginner-friendly poses include child pose, downward dog, warrior I and II, and tree pose.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['health', 'fitness', 'yoga']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Machine Learning Fundamentals',\n      body: 'Machine learning is a subset of artificial intelligence where algorithms learn patterns from data without being explicitly programmed. Key types include s